/target
.env
/attachments/
*.pem
*.key

# The blanket *.pem rule above also caught redmine-client's TLS test
# fixtures, which `tests/tls.rs` pulls in with `include_str!` — so the crate
# did not compile from a fresh clone. These two files are throwaway
# self-signed certs holding no real identity; see the README beside them.
# Keep this exception to exactly that directory: nothing outside it is
# reviewed for being safe to publish.
!/crates/redmine-client/tests/certs/*.pem

